The [[Candy Ring]] is a {{Rare}} [[Accessory]] that can be bought from the [[Fear Mongerer]]. It increases the chance of finding {{LinkImage|Green Candy}} and {{LinkImage|Purple Candy}} from mobs during the [[Spooky Festival]] by {{Green|10%}}. It is the upgraded form of the [[Candy Talisman]] and can be further upgraded into the [[Candy Artifact]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Shop Purchase ===
It can be purchased from the {{NPCSprite|Fear Mongerer}} during the [[Spooky Festival]] for {{Item|Candy Talisman|amount=1}} and {{Item|Green Candy|amount=64}}.

